326178104698856,\"y\":0.5619106882556736,\"height\":0.016056151498800797,\"text\":\"not very satisfactory, and we hope to gain\",\"width\":0.37551345896967603},{\"x\":0.07337527068074993,\"y\":0.5494186048645138,\"height\":0.014534883778724361,\"text\":\"greater success in the years to come.\",\"width\":0.3333333141940557},{\"x\":0.11740041918866483,\"y\":0.5319218243936368,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"text\":\"Our school has long built up the fame\",\"width\":0.3312369029923418},{\"x\":0.07337526650453727,\"y\":0.5188925084331564,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"text\":\"of its badminton teams, especially in the ‘C’\",\"width\":0.3752620549888288},{\"x\":0.07319297148921262,\"y\":0.5042350722544784,\"height\":0.017337393372377274,\"text\":\"Grade Pool which has been outstanding.y\",\"width\":0.37565421878674743},{\"x\":0.07337525742448439,\"y\":0.49120521141682083,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"text\":\"successful in these last few years. However，\",\"width\":0.37735849489945905},{\"x\":0.07321572285945513,\"y\":0.47666642205195464,\"height\":0.01664078802549873,\"text\":\"to keep up these records is not an easy thing\",\"width\":0.37564707026656574},{\"x\":0.07337526861034784,\"y\":0.46351791516124097,\"height\":0.013355048859934882,\"text\":\"to do. We need new players.\",\"width\":0.2620545007772078},{\"x\":0.35426230806718856,\"y\":0.46497731044198054,\"height\":0.011905844747437722,\"text\":\"We have a\",\"width\":0.09441039120377176},{\"x\":0.07547170142316488,\"y\":0.4534201955452468,\"height\":0.010242595113449937,\"text\":\"very good badminton court in our school\",\"width\":0.37316561507819845},{\"x\":0.07337526322024067,\"y\":0.4374592835404112,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"text\":\"hall.\",\"width\":0.03983228294107001},{\"x\":0.11530398724259498,\"y\":0.43604651159901,\"height\":0.014534883778724361,\"text\":\"So boys of Form 1 and 2, I ask you\",\"width\":0.3333333141940557},{\"x\":0.07337527102771965,\"y\":0.42296511600792464,\"height\":0.014534883778724361,\"text\":\"to make good use of it. It is meant for\",\"width\":0.3773584661905427},{\"x\":0.0733752646047777,\"y\":0.4097719867362196,\"height\":0.01335504885993477,\"text\":\"you. Anyone of you might become a fu-\",\"width\":0.37735849489945905},{\"x\":0.07327760565403035,\"y\":0.39675654904899427,\"height\":0.013401650295195466,\"text\":\"ture badminton star of Wah Yan.\",\"width\":0.30211770747589367},{\"x\":0.2012578619242796,\"y\":0.35755813982714224,\"height\":0.013125899249645356,\"text\":\"‘C’GRADE\",\"width\":0.11530397976779314},{\"x\":0.1174004344124059,\"y\":0.33575581405462795,\"height\":0.011627906774465013,\"text\":\"Our‘C’ Grade Badmination team is\",\"width\":0.33333331419405576},{\"x\":0.07337525868657797,\"y\":0.31976744212244257,\"height\":0.013131580911940777,\"text\":\"quite successful this year. We defeated\",\"width\":0.3752620549888288},{\"x\":0.07337526707927973,\"y\":0.3052117262805444,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"text\":\"D.B.S. and captured the‘C’\",\"width\":0.23689726491301888},{\"x\":0.3078582572894005,\"y\":0.3048455176289041,\"height\":0.016022571600997848,\"text\":\"garade Badmina-\",\"width\":0.14315846139041188},{\"x\":0.07312566703769625,\"y\":0.28871002610888585,\"height\":0.01967942427346292,\"text\":\"tion Championship. And now, we have cap-\",\"width\":0.3778487570646902},{\"x\":0.07337528053156282,\"y\":0.2775244300014278,\"height\":0.014657980456025954,\"text\":\"tured the Championship for three consecu-\",\"width\":0.3773584661905427},{\"x\":0.0731757483883781,\"y\":0.26517625419027124,\"height\":0.013252143362834312,\"text\":\"tive years.\",\"width\":0.09264221622039996},{\"x\":0.18238993209769114,\"y\":0.26449511427126027,\"height\":0.013121164427518095,\"text\":\"we also won several prizes in\",\"width\":0.2662473805984684},{\"x\":0.07337526781121709,\"y\":0.25145348829474634,\"height\":0.014670289999499042,\"text\":\"the Individual Championships.\",\"width\":0.26415094068783807},{\"x\":0.11740042540196317,\"y\":0.23837209358804334,\"height\":0.013093704198781309,\"text\":\"Here I thank Mr. Adrian Lee for his\",\"width\":0.33123687428342546},{\"x\":0.0733752646047777,\"y\":0.22238372097400994,\"height\":0.01453488377872425,\"text\":\"guidance and enthusiastic support through-\",\"width\":0.37735849489945905},{\"x\":0.07337528053156282,\"y\":0.21074918560061395,\"height\":0.011726384364820874,\"text\":\"out the year.l also hope that our Badmina-\",\"width\":0.3773584661905427},{\"x\":0.07337528018801301,\"y\":0.1960912053753323,\"height\":0.013355048859934882,\"text\":\"tion team will be champions next year.\",\"width\":0.3459119249489211},{\"x\":0.283018869754751,\"y\":0.18459302350230256,\"height\":0.011627906774464902,\"text\":\"Ho Che Sun （capt.）\",\"width\":0.167714877052343},{\"x\":0.13417190840877566,\"y\":0.1553745925835791,\"height\":0.014683547004426312,\"text\":\"‘C’Grade Badminton Team\",\"width\":0.25157232993297274},{\"x\":0.07127882749051426,\"y\":0.13224755680011446,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"text\":\"（Left to Right）\",\"width\":0.13207547034391903},{\"x\":0.07332961289436978,\"y\":0.12047297975102467,\"height\":0.013414505949237876,\"text\":\"Back Row：\",\"width\":0.09862379072302373},{\"x\":0.07547170255353011,\"y\":0.10456026051407663,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"text\":\"Mr. Adrian Lee，\",\"width\":0.16142557167491034},{\"x\":0.23480083952446287,\"y\":0.10456026046562694,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"text\":\"Ho Che Sun, Chang\",\"width\":0.21383646895946026},{\"x\":0.07547170551266658,\"y\":0.09302325614254925,\"height\":0.013165669021854898,\"text\":\"Chien Ming, Brother Thoo.\",\"width\":0.24528301020108184},{\"x\":0.07328593253492083,\"y\":0.08060297664821703,\"height\":0.011829069305320461,\"text\":\"Front Row：\",\"width\":0.1030637753649018},{\"x\":0.07337527579081268,\"y\":0.06384364804953546,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"text\":\"Lam Sui Lung, Chan Ngai Cheung.\",\"width\":0.33333331419405576},{\"x\":0.6457023072428758,\"y\":0.815309446297849,\"height\":0.008818460520393367,\"text\":\"HESSA\",\"width\":0.048218028229133014},{\"x\":0.555555556626805,\"y\":0.66860465152409,\"height\":0.01315430631855019,\"text\":\"‘B’Grade Badminton Team\",\"width\":0.25157232993297274},{\"x\":0.49475891225711316,\"y\":0.6409883722458123,\"height\":0.01453488377872425,\"text\":\"（Left to Right）\",\"width\":0.13626833581072145},{\"x\":0.4947589125444752,\"y\":0.6263843647103629,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"text\":\"Mr. Cheung\",\"width\":0.11530397976779311},{\"x\":0.6247379519532283,\"y\":0.6263843650409513,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"text\":\"Man Sun, Thomas Chok，\",\"width\":0.24737945011171214},{\"x\":0.49475890600939,\"y\":0.6119186050277743,\"height\":0.016094424592555612,\"text\":\"Cheng Lap Yan, Lee Chi Fai, Tsang Wing\",\"width\":0.37735849489945905},{\"x\":0.4947589110439272,\"y\":0.5986970682547514,\"height\":0.014675024821626304,\"text\":\"Cho，\",\"width\":0.04402515558510145},{\"x\":0.5534591256081868,\"y\":0.5986970681213379,\"height\":0.016286644951140072,\"text\":\"Leung Wang To, Michael Chok，\",\"width\":0.3186582635285601},{\"x\":0.4968553464475744,\"y\":0.5872093026868807,\"height\":0.013116430226676967,\"text\":\"Brother Thoo.\",\"width\":0.12578616496648637},{\"x\":0.5408805093315514,\"y\":0.5465116279749789,\"height\":0.01453488377872425,\"text\":\"Anyway, badminton has\",\"width\":0.21593290887009053},{\"x\":0.7567529954955987,\"y\":0.5477052878390005,\"height\":0.013601052100961297,\"text\":\"always been\",\"width\":0.11542482277411736},{\"x\":0.4968553643890051,\"y\":0.5334302325776921,\"height\":0.01453488377872425,\"text\":\"regarded as a very good training both phy-\",\"width\":0.3773584661905427},{\"x\":0.4947589149279038,\"y\":0.5188925083241449,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"text\":\"sically and mentally.\",\"width\":0.18448636762846893},{\"x\":0.6897274605019761,\"y\":0.5174418606636755,\"height\":0.016108627816364907,\"text\":\"It is also your duty\",\"width\":0.1802935021616665},{\"x\":0.49685535830934086,\"y\":0.507166123693106,\"height\":0.013182713387455136,\"text\":\"towards the school to keep our school bad-\",\"width\":0.37735846619054264},{\"x\":0.4968553441656208,\"y\":0.4927325583528859,\"height\":0.014534883778724361,\"text\":\"minton on a high level.\",\"width\":0.20964360349265787},{\"x\":0.5387840794333704,\"y\":0.4781758956139789,\"height\":0.013103173843035831,\"text\":\"On behalf of the ‘B’ Grade Badminton\",\"width\":0.33333331419405576},{\"x\":0.4967775901198661,\"y\":0.4633950773971688,\"height\":0.015493008989464596,\"text\":\"Team, I here express my sincere thanks to\",\"width\":0.3754280786523254},{\"x\":0.4968553503619796,\"y\":0.44912790698418437,\"height\":0.01453488377872425,\"text\":\"Father Principal. Mr. Yu, Br. Thoo, Mr.\",\"width\":0.3752620549888288},{\"x\":0.4968553430932767,\"y\":0.4360465119504465,\"height\":0.013139155633286492,\"text\":\"K. T. Tsang，\",\"width\":0.12578616496648642},{\"x\":0.620545088587094,\"y\":0.4360465119504465,\"height\":0.013139155633286492,\"text\":\"Mr. M. S. Cheung and Mr.\",\"width\":0.2536687411346866},{\"x\":0.4987963796878004,\"y\":0.4210181804916746,\"height\":0.017525701491762802,\"text\":\"C. H. Lee for their enthusiastic support and\",\"width\":0.3734637858838488},{\"x\":0.4968553517552972,\"y\":0.40977198683597515,\"height\":0.01042345276872958,\"text\":\"encouragement to uS.\",\"width\":0.18448636762846898},{\"x\":0.7798742142983336,\"y\":0.39825581404697197,\"height\":0.010213241204376722,\"text\":\"Li Chi Fai\",\"width\":0.09224318381423446},{\"x\":0.6582809228221147,\"y\":0.22238372140781093,\"height\":0.013121164427517984,\"text\":\"HKSSA\",\"width\":0.05660377351719603},{\"x\":0.6792452828570401,\"y\":0.2136627907835017,\"height\":0.008812779168741014,\"text\":\"BOSC\",\"width\":0.027253668597590153}]",
